  "description": "Within the checked bundle, IDs and keys are unique, vocabulary arrays declared sorted are sorted, every resolved reference finds its document, revision and element with the expected kind, pinned inputs agree with each other, revision-bound decisions are not stale, size keys, cut instances and configuration keys resolve, recomputed digests match, and fixture manifests list exactly their files. Unresolved measurement definitions are reported by the rule d2p:measurements-complete.",
